ion was not yet available when the order was paid. ",[500,969,970],{},"listForSubscription()"," also returns renewal lines whose ",[500,973,955],{},[500,975,976],{},"subscription",[500,978,979],{},"productId"," is the subscription id, so renewals stored without the link still appear.",[496,982,983,984,987,988,993,994,997],{},"For refund creation, credit-note fields, and the full order schema, use the underlying SDK through ",[500,985,986],{},"getApiClient()"," and the ",[646,989,305],{"href":990,"rel":991},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference",[992],"nofollow",". See ",[646,995,996],{"href":226},"Event flow"," for persistence behavior.",[999,1000,1001],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark